# HireVault bootstrap

Monorepo: Next.js app (`apps/web`), Chrome extension (`apps/extension`), shared packages (`packages/*`). Product loop: **capture → applications → resumes → interviews**.

## How to begin (save context)

Do **not** read the whole repo or `docs/archive/` unless the user asks for history.

| User intent (keywords) | Read first | Code entry |
|------------------------|------------|------------|
| Applications, pipeline, kanban, list | `docs/NAVIGATION.md` (Applications) | `lib/applications/`, `components/applications/` |
| Resumes, tailor, PDF, ATS | `docs/decisions/phase-5.md` | `lib/resumes/`, `packages/ai-core/src/resume.ts` |
| Extension, scraper, capture | `docs/decisions/phase-4.md` | `apps/extension/`, `app/api/extension/capture/` |
| Profile, import, LinkedIn | `docs/decisions/phase-1.md` | `lib/profile/`, `lib/ingestion/` |
| Interviews, questions, prep | `docs/decisions/phase-6.md` | `lib/interviews/`, `components/interviews/` |
| Schema, RLS, auth | `docs/setup/database.md` | `packages/supabase/migrations/`, `lib/supabase/` |
| Env, OAuth, deploy | `docs/setup/environment.md` | repo root `.env` only |
| Bug / regression | `docs/OPERATIONS.md` | then the failing module only |

**Always skim** `docs/PRODUCT.md` out-of-scope table before adding features.

**Living snapshot** (routes, env, gaps): `docs/STATE.md` — only when routes or env matter.

Full hub: `docs/README.md`. Human/agent entry: `AGENTS.md`.

## Out of scope (do not reintroduce)

Mock interviews, coaching insights, pitch/summary engine, standalone `/jobs` route, HTML resume PDF. Historical ADRs: `docs/decisions/phase-7.md`, `phase-8.md`.

## Commands

```bash
pnpm dev              # web :3000
pnpm quality:check    # typecheck + lint + test + build — run before finishing code tasks
pnpm db db push       # apply migrations (never db reset in automation)
```

## Conventions

- Reads: `lib/{domain}/queries.ts` · Mutations: `lib/{domain}/actions.ts` (`"use server"`)
- Applications → Resumes link: `resumeBuilderUrl()` in `apps/web/lib/resumes/urls.ts`
- Schema changes: new file in `packages/supabase/migrations/` → update `packages/types` if shapes change
- Env: repo root `.env` only — never `apps/web/.env.local`
- Minimal diff; match surrounding code style; no marketing fluff in UI
